CORE
main.c
--unwind 2 --rounds 4 --por --allow-pointer-unsoundness
^EXIT=0$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION SUCCESSFUL$
--
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
The same program as array_read_from on the default path, i.e. with the array
still carried through the lazy chain. The two encodings have to agree; this is
the arm that says so.

--no-array-rf also reproduces the pre-change formula to the digit on the
benchmarks the change was measured on (25_stack_longer-1 at u2 r3: 144700
variables, 538556 clauses either way).
